00:23:56.230 --> 00:24:00.970
♪Magpakailanman♪

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:05.740
♪Babe, mahal kita!♪

00:24:39.340 --> 00:24:41.500
Hindi ito ang trangkaso, isang karaniwang sipon lamang.

00:24:41.951 --> 00:24:43.260
Magrereseta ako ng gamot.

00:24:43.260 --> 00:24:44.630
Dapat kang maging mas mahusay sa loob ng isang linggo.

00:24:45.430 --> 00:24:47.500
Pero kailangan mo talagang magpahinga lately.

00:24:47.500 --> 00:24:48.430
Mukhang pagod na pagod ka.

00:24:48.950 --> 00:24:49.870
Pahinga? Anong pahinga?

00:24:49.995 --> 00:24:51.751
Maraming bumabagabag sa akin lately.

00:24:51.910 --> 00:24:53.710
Tungkol pa rin sa paglipat ng trabaho?

00:24:55.540 --> 00:24:56.740
Bigla kong gustong lumipat,

00:24:56.795 --> 00:24:58.060
